      "message": "The flag is more than execution just went through DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE.  It indicates that it in fact enabled DRP.  The code goes through whether DRP is really requested or not. I tried what you gave me and the USB thumb drive that I inserted was ignored.\n\nIt does feel like a hack but not sure the right way to wait for the TOGGLE_OFF execution of wake up from LOW_POWER into DRP_AUTO_TOGGLE can be accelerated to get it out of that state and back to LOW_POWER to perform as it is supposed to.\n\nI can\u0027t access the link from my workstation.  I will look from my CrBook in a bit.  From the rest of the comment, I agree that this is a race condition.  I just don\u0027t know how to slow down one or speed up the other.",
